eld":7.8,"_gate_int_coverage":10.617507546356189,"_gp_int_coverage":true,"_score_int_coverage":50.6,"_gate_net_debt_ebitda":-0.8068941592027249,"_gp_net_debt_ebitda":true,"_score_net_debt_ebitda":100.0,"_gate_accruals":0.0029140741907537214,"_gp_accruals":true,"_score_accruals":13.6,"_gate_rev_volatility":0.28118508285055943,"_gp_rev_volatility":false,"_score_rev_volatility":33.9,"_gate_margin_vs_hist":0.0007535969977253421,"_gp_margin_vs_hist":true,"_score_margin_vs_hist":99.1,"_gate_piotroski":5,"_gp_piotroski":false,"_score_piotroski":55.6,"_gate_spread":0.0018338860341515079,"_gp_spread":false,"_score_spread":0.9,"_gate_roic_consistency":0.553877910858473,"_gp_roic_consistency":false,"_score_roic_consistency":7.7,"_gate_incr_roic":0.09494748098421928,"_gp_incr_roic":false,"_score_incr_roic":48.3,"_gate_margin_advantage":-0.06232970239896954,"_gp_margin_advantage":false,"_score_margin_advantage":12.6,"_gate_pool_share":-0.08392059150882392,"_gp_pool_share":false,"_score_pool_share":6.4,"_gate_rev_durability":null,"_gp_rev_durability":null,"_score_rev_durability":0.0,"_gate_fcf_durability":0.3767182561917528,"_gp_fcf_durability":true,"_score_fcf_durability":100.0,"_gate_margins":null,"_gp_margins":null,"_score_margins":0.0,"_gate_fund_growth":0.05205566414407191,"_gp_fund_growth":true,"_score_fund_growth":52.1,"_gate_shrhldr_yield":0.007960533330299533,"_gp_shrhldr_yield":false,"_score_shrhldr_yield":20.0,"_gate_share_shrink":-0.009992903978012446,"_gp_share_shrink":true,"_score_share_shrink":62.5,"_gate_sbc_dilution":0.0017766247554465322,"_gp_sbc_dilution":true,"_score_sbc_dilution":97.0,"_gate_insider_own":0.24053,"_gp_insider_own":true,"_score_insider_own":100.0,"_gate_insider_buying":0.0,"_gp_insider_buying":false,"_score_insider_buying":0.0,"pf":[],"description_full":"Radiant Logistics, Inc., operates as a third-party logistics company, provides technology-enabled global transportation and value-added logistics services in the United States, Canada, and Mexico. The company offers domestic and international air and ocean freight forwarding, and freight brokerage services, including truckload, less-than-truckload (LTL), and intermodal. It also provides other value-added logistics services including materials management and distribution, customs house brokerage, global trade management, and related technology services, as well as arranging shipments, and heavyweight and small package air services. The company serves consumer goods, food and beverages, electronics, high-tech, aviation, automotive, military, government, manufacturing, and retail industries. The company was formerly known as Golf Two Inc. and changed its name to Radiant Logistics, Inc. in October 2005. Radiant Logistics, Inc. was incorporated in 2001 and is headquartered in Renton, Washington.","ceo_bio":"Mr. Bohn H. Crain | Founder, CEO & Chairman | Age 61 | Compensation: $659,361 (FY2026)","culture_narrative":"Employs approximately 1K people. Revenue per employee of $865K ranks in the top quartile among Industrials peers. Each employee generates $12K of free cash flow annually. Stock-based compensation of $2K per employee reflects an ownership culture. CEO compensation is 1\u00d7 revenue per employee (modest relative to workforce productivity). Governance score flags low compensation governance risk (2/10).","financial_summary":["Radiant Logistics, Inc. is a small-cap industrials business with a $439M market cap on $934M of annual revenue.","The top line has compounded at -5% over the past three years, and a shrinking top line is the hardest headwind any business can overcome.","Returns on capital run at 10% against a 9% cost of capital, which means the business barely earns its keep economically, with gross margins sitting at 26%.","The business throws off $13M in free cash flow \u2014 roughly 1 cents on every revenue dollar, which is the owner-earnings figure that actually belongs to shareholders, with adequate 0.93\u00d7 cash conversion.","On the balance sheet, the balance sheet carries net cash, which is the gold standard: the business never has to make desperate decisions in a bad year, and interest coverage runs at 10.6\u00d7.","Shareholder yield is only 0.8%, a thin return of capital, and insiders hold 24% of the shares, so management thinks like owners because it is one \u2014 the strongest alignment there is, and profit capture is only 0.2\u00d7 the fair share, suggesting no structural edge inside its industry."],"sector_headwinds":[{"text":"Fragmented industry with below-average profit capture \u2014 no moat to protect margins","sev":"amber","cat":"moat"},{"text":"Priced near or above estimated fair value, so the margin of safety has been bid away","sev":"amber","cat":"valuation","magnitude":0.03030669317868036},{"text":"Volatile returns on capital suggest the moat is narrower than a snapshot ROIC implies","sev":"amber","cat":"moat"},{"text":"Revenue growth lags most Industrials peers \u2014 losing share inside the profit pool","sev":"amber","cat":"growth"},{"text":"Industrials sector lagging the market significantly, underperforming by 6% over 3 months","sev":"amber","cat":"sector"},{"text":"Cyclicality and capital intensity \u2014 order books turn on a dime, and the heavy fixed cost base that creates the moat also magnifies the downturn.","sev":"amber","cat":"thesis_risk"},{"text":"Supply chain reshoring costs and labour shortages \u2014 onshoring mandates raise capex requirements while a shrinking skilled-labour pool inflates operating costs.","sev":"amber","cat":"thesis_risk"},{"text":"Tariff and trade-policy exposure \u2014 industrial exporters sit squarely in the crosshairs of protectionist policy, and retaliatory tariffs can close markets without warning.","sev":"amber","cat":"thesis_risk"}],"sector_tailwinds":["Altman Z comfortably in the safe zone \u2014 a fortress balance sheet on this measure","Founder-led \u2014 owner alignment that often matters more than any incentive plan","Among the least levered in Industrials \u2014 the fortress balance sheet in its peer set"],"news_headlines":[{"title":"Radiant (RLGT) Q1 2027 Earnings Call Transcript","source":"fool.com","link":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/11/10/radiant-rlgt-q1-2027-earnings-call-transcript/?source=iedfolrf0000001","date":"2026-11-10","timestamp":1794292921.0,"origin":"tiingo","sentiment":-0.19,"tier":0,"scope":"company","tags":["earnings"]},{"title":"Radiant logistics signals move upmarket on acquisitions with $100m accordion through 2031 facility (NYSE:RLGT)","source":"seekingalpha.com","link":"https://seekingalpha.com/news/4669420-radiant-logistics-signals-move-upmarket-on-acquisitions-with-100m-accordion-through-2031","date":"2026-11-10","timestamp":1794272604.0,"origin":"tiingo","sentiment":0.832,"tier":0,"scope":"company","tags":[]},{"title":"How (RLGT) Movements Inform Risk Allocation Models","source":"news.stocktradersdaily.com","link":"https://news.stocktradersdaily.com/news_release/139/How_RLGT_Movements_Inform_Risk_Allocation_Models_110526082402_1793885042.html","date":"2026-11-05","timestamp":1793885042.0,"origin":"tiingo","sentiment":-0.026,"tier":0,"scope":"company","tags":[]},{"title":"Radiant Logistics touts enhanced credit facility, eyes larger M&A","source":"finance.yahoo.com","link":"https://finance.yahoo.com/markets/stocks/articles/radiant-logistics-touts-enhanced-credit-014046986.html","date":"2026-11-10","timestamp":1794274846.0,"origin":"tiingo","sentiment":0.938,"tier":1,"scope":"company","tags":[]},{"title":"RADIANT LOGISTICS ANNOUNCES RESULTS FOR THE FIRST FISCAL QUARTER ENDED SEPTEMBER 30, 2026","source":"prnewswire.com","link":"https://www.prnewswire.com/news-releases/radiant-logistics-announces-results-for-the-first-fiscal-quarter-ended-september-30-2026-302933840.html","date":"2026-11-09","timestamp":1794258300.0,"origin":"tiingo","sentiment":0.786,"tier":1,"scope":"company","tags":["earnings"]},{"title":"RADIANT LOGISTICS TO HOST INVESTOR CALL T